**Aphids and Ladybugs** is a small Rust simulation of two species sharing a
two-dimensional board. Aphids and ladybugs move, eat the food under them,
reproduce when they crowd a cell, starve when the cell runs dry, and fight
whenever predator and prey meet.

The same simulation core drives two front ends: a printing command-line runner
and a Bevy-powered visual explorer with live parameter controls.

